  "Question": "On a number line, point A represents -3, point B is to the right of the origin, and the distance between A and B is 5. What number is represented by the midpoint of segment AB? (Write your answer as a fraction in simplest form or a decimal.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "-1/2",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "B is to the right of the origin, so it represents \\(-3+5=2\\). The midpoint represents \\((-3+2)\\div2=-1/2\\).",
